            "title": "美國長債息率近逾24年高位　兩年期債息下跌",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美國長債孳息率先跌後回升，10年期及30年期債息貼近近日創下的逾24年高位。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"美國國債。\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/../blogger/2024/01/20240103_BLOG_-5.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"美國國債。\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/../blogger/2024/01/20240103_BLOG_-5.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">美國國債。</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10年期債息高見5.298厘，升逾6個基點；30年期債息高見5.647厘，升逾4個基點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">兩年期債息則創兩星期新低，低見4.693厘，跌逾9個基點。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">全周，10年期收益率累計上升約12個基點，連續第五周攀升；而2年期收益率全周下降約3個基點，結束此前六周連漲。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16898032-%e7%be%8e%e5%9c%8b%e9%95%b7%e5%82%b5%e6%81%af%e7%8e%87%e8%bf%91%e9%80%be24%e5%b9%b4%e9%ab%98%e4%bd%8d%e3%80%80%e5%85%a9%e5%b9%b4%e6%9c%9f%e5%82%b5%e6%81%af%e4%b8%8b%e8%b7%8c",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20190902_FI_US-TREASURY-BONDS_US-BOND_FB-1-2-1-1-1-1_source-web_-1-2-1.jpg.webp",
